{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Step into the world of shadows.</strong><br>In this demo of <i>Fallen Hunter</i>, experience the beginning of a dark, emotional journey through a world scarred by corruption and human despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as two skilled hunter marked by tragedy, navigating cursed lands, uncovering forgotten truths, and confronting monstrous foes born of guilt. Engage in intense third-person combat, uncover hidden lore, and witness the first steps of a story that questions obedience, power, and sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A glimpse into the atmospheric world of <i>Fallen Hunter</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fluid melee combat with dynamic animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A haunting soundtrack and cinematic storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A deep, lore-driven narrative exploring themes of faith, betrayal, and inner torment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you endure the darkness... or become part of it?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720740?t=1746897856","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720740/7656e1117af8e42c81f505c3db7b09893ca07729/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746897856","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720740/1fd11f9dbba8ccbf897367e6501cc1f05f6ae64f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746897856","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720740/1fd11f9dbba8ccbf897367e6501cc1f05f6ae64f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746897856","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"contro